  "description": "<p data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"432\">De <strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"200\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Velleman</span></span> DEM201</strong> is een <strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"239\">digitale geluidsniveaumeter</strong>, geschikt voor het nauwkeurig meten van geluidsniveaus in uiteenlopende omgevingen. Ideaal voor gebruik bij werkplaatsen, installaties, evenementen, hobbyprojecten of algemene geluidscontrole.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"526\">Deze geluidsniveaumeter wordt geleverd <strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"490\">nieuw in doos</strong> en komt met <strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"525\">6 maanden garantie</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"558\">🔊 Belangrijkste kenmerken</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<li data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"582\">\r\n<p data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"582\">📊 Digitaal display</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"636\">\r\n<p data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"636\">🔉 Frequentieweging: <strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"634\">dB(A)-meting en C-weging</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"676\">\r\n<p data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"676\">⏱️ Tijdweging: <strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"674\">Snel en Langzaam</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"728\">🔌 Automatische uitschakeling na <strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"726\">15 minuten</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<p data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"767\">🔋 Werkt op <strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"765\">9V batterij (6F22)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"800\">📐 Technische specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<li data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"837\">Type product: Geluidsniveaumeter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"865\">\r\n<p data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"865\">Accu/Batterijtype: 6F22</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"896\">Accu/Batterij voltage: 9 V</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"915\">Breedte: 62 mm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"933\">Diepte: 32 mm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<p data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"952\">Hoogte: 189 mm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"982\">🔍 Staat van het product</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<li data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1004\"><strong data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1002\">Nieuw in doos</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1019\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1019\">Ongebruikt</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1044\">Volledig functioneel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1061\">📦 Levering</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1100\">Velleman DEM201 geluidsniveaumeter</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1125\">Originele verpakking</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1257\">Een <strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1161\">betrouwbaar meetinstrument</strong> voor wie snel en eenvoudig geluidsniveaus wil controleren, zowel professioneel als particulier.</p>",
